======================================================================================================================
  LCDM (omega_c = 0.1200)                      z_eq =   3402.0  r_s(z_*) =  144.44 Mpc  D_A =  13894.0 Mpc  100 theta_* = 1.03957  k_D = 0.0903/Mpc
